          <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(25,211,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(25,211,255,.28);color:#19D3FF;flex-shrink:0;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3.5 2"></path></svg></span>
          <div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:17px;color:#F6F7FB;">Horarios</div><div style="font-size:14.5px;color:#9AA0AE;">Lun a Vie: — · Sáb y Dom: — <span style="opacity:.7;">(a confirmar)</span></div></div>
